Seconded. I have always played it that K.N.Y.F.E. takes the damage if there isn&#39;t a second highest villain target.

[/quote]

If there is only one villain target, it is both the highest HP villain and the lowest HP villain. That is confirmed as we all know that Haka&#39;s punish the weak will still get a +1 when hitting a lone villain target.&nbsp;

If a single villain target can be both the highest HP villain and the lowest HP villain target at the same time, it seems to follow that it would also be the 2nd highest, 3rd highest, ect ect. to infinity.

Confirmation would be nice, but I believe this to be the correct way to view it.

